# Nadu, Winged Wisdom gives Sheoldred, the Apocalypse "whenever this creature becomes the target ... This ability triggers
# only twice each turn." (CR 603.2h). Two Unholy Heats aimed at Sheoldred in one turn trigger it twice, and the count is
# Sheoldred's own: Nadu's copy of the ability is untouched.
#
# Handed over at the second main phase with both Heats resolved, so the client can be pictured with the granted line on
# Sheoldred's face and in its tooltip, greyed out because it has triggered all it may this turn.

